  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "ContextASR-Bench",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tContextASR-Bench: A Massive Contextual Speech Recognition Benchmark\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\nAutomatic Speech Recognition (ASR) has been extensively investigated, yet prior benchmarks have largely focused on assessing the acoustic robustness of ASR models, leaving evaluations of their linguistic capabilities relatively underexplored. This largely stems from the limited parameter sizes and training corpora of conventional ASR models, leaving them with insufficient world knowledge, which is crucial for\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/MrSupW/ContextASR-Bench.",
